      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tTQiv1xKVM4"
    },
    {
      "caption": "Example application in Umbraco",
      "contentTypeKey": "bfeed15c-3ebb-46d4-b805-07d0f9b083c7",
      "udi": "umb://element/c9de046ede324f818f9654c2bde0513b"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "394dc214-e2ad-4605-ab3f-2c6b83063ef6",
      "text": "",
      "udi": "umb://element/06cf8ca564f54dff8c4812466ff38757"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>Videos can be added to the block grid or block list and are displayed using the <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/171780\">official YouTube player in privacy-enhanced mode</a>.</p>\n<p>Videos can be set to auto-play, but it should be avoided as it <a href=\"https://abilitynet.org.uk/news-blogs/why-autoplay-accessibility-issue\">creates accessibility problems and uses unnecessary bandwidth</a>.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
